# ML brand & SEO

Before changing layout, copy, routing, metadata, product pages, images, or SEO, read `docs/ML_PROJECT_CONTEXT.md`. For landing layout, also read `docs/design/ml-daily-landing-desktop.png`.

Non-negotiables:

- Premium, restrained storefront — SEO must not look like keyword stuffing.
- Customer-facing copy defaults to Ukrainian; English only for brand/product names (ML, ML Daily).
- Server Components by default; do not `"use client"` an entire page for one interactive island.
- Do not invent unlocked facts (price, full wordmark, extra colors, key dock, shoulder strap).
- Repo product/config wins over this doc if they conflict — flag the mismatch.
- Landing composition matches `docs/design/ml-daily-landing-desktop.png`; do not invent extra sections.
